*> vybe-test: cobol/move_semantics/test_move_multiple_destinations
*> origin: languages/cobol/tests/cobol/test_move_semantics.rs
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. T.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-SRC PIC X(5) VALUE "HELLO".
01 WS-DST1 PIC X(5) VALUE "AAAAA".
01 WS-DST2 PIC X(5) VALUE "BBBBB".
01 WS-DST3 PIC X(5) VALUE "CCCCC".
01 WS-VYBE-L PIC X(256).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.

    MOVE WS-SRC TO WS-DST1 WS-DST2 WS-DST3.
    DISPLAY WS-DST1.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-DST1 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-DST2.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-DST2 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    DISPLAY WS-DST3.
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-VYBE-L
    STRING WS-DST3 DELIMITED SIZE INTO WS-VYBE-L
    IF WS-VYBE-L NOT = "HELLO"
        DISPLAY "FAIL: want [HELLO] got [" WS-VYBE-L "]"
        MOVE 1 TO RETURN-CODE
        RAISE EXCEPTION EC-PROGRAM
    END-IF.
    STOP RUN.

